{
	"name": "Legerdemain",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 2nd level, you begin expanding your mystical repertoire to gain magical benefits which are not cantrip-related. These tricks of the trade may not be the defining trait of a warcaster, but they often help both on and off the battlefield. You gain two Legerdemains at 2nd level and additional Legerdemains as shown on the warcaster table.</p><p>Whenever you gain a new Legerdemain, you may also choose to replace a legerdemain you already know with a new one so long as you meet any requirements such as level.</p><p>The list of available Legerdemains can be found at the end of the warcaster class entry.</p><p></p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.Q521MbGekSSAhMen]{Aerial Assault}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.2NLZ0CG87f2zLq4l]{Airdrop}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.4lXY5p4Yby8CRyQB]{Battlefield Repairs}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.TKcXlX91LTZ5xClH]{Burst of Speed}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.O2nS3xOsuv5b1fkV]{Cavalry Call}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.6WR0rliXWHtLfhC9]{Ceaseless Trudging}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.2o0eQdgsLyhVnIkp]{Civilian Guise}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.ygIaiySEHaYhikkm]{Deep Well}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.CBvIQb9fXRJquERz]{Demolition Assisted Entry}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.KrSOIaPNrsy7kVZw]{Fog of War}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.aFwWDuRQgtfh88BG]{Highstep}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.26RILSK5YN44d6sq]{Hovering Artillery}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.KWOBXQ44UfQwjNia]{Illusory Army}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.qYqsT6ZdjgsOMVNN]{Instant Crenelations}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.ko7HfBopRUxNtSsd]{Larian’s Environmental Disturbance}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.W